                "description": "The Hermes Lever with Modern Rosette has a chicness about it that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. This beautiful, sharp leverset will add a modern look to any home remodel, and since it is available in a wide array of popular finishes, you'll be sure to find just the right one to be the finishing touch to your rooms. The Hermes Lever with Modern Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
